{
  "name": "04 · Error Alert → Slack (monitors all workflows)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-error-alert",
      "name": "Overview · Error Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -500,
        250
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🚨 04 · Error Alert\n**If any automation breaks, the team knows within seconds, not days.**\n\n### How it is attached\nWorkflows 01, 02 and 03 have this workflow set as their **Error Workflow** (*Workflow settings → Error workflow*). `deploy.mjs` links them automatically.\n\n### The alert contains\n- Workflow name\n- The node that failed\n- The error message\n- A link to the failed execution\n\n### Setup\n- 🔑 **Slack** → *Alert #automation-alerts*\n\n### Note\nError workflows fire only for **production (active)** executions, not manual test runs.",
        "color": 1,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 640
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-1-1-catch",
      "name": "Stage 1 · ① Catch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        250
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ① Catch\nError Trigger",
        "color": 3,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-2-2-alert",
      "name": "Stage 2 · ② Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        250
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ② Alert\nPost to Slack",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "on-workflow-error",
      "name": "On Workflow Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        70,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "notes": "Fires when 01–03 fail",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alert-automation-alerts",
      "name": "Alert #automation-alerts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        350,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#automation-alerts",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=🚨 *Workflow failed:* {{ $json.workflow.name }}\n*Node:* {{ $json.execution.lastNodeExecuted }}\n*Error:* {{ $json.execution.error.message }}\n*Execution:* {{ $json.execution.url }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "notes": "Workflow · node · error · link",
      "notesInFlow": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "On Workflow Error": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert #automation-alerts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/New_York",
    "saveManualExecutions": true
  }
}
